 "markup": "<div class=\"swiper-container character-swiper swiper-container-fade swiper-container-initialized swiper-container-horizontal swiper-container-ios\"> <div class=\"swiper-wrapper\"><div class=\"character-swiper-slide swiper-slide swiper-slide-active\" style=\"width: 390px; opacity: 1; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);\"><img src=\"https://fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/166076/6c20298349992ef86b067bc8330cc313_7372893491764088783.png\" class=\"character-cover\"> <div class=\"character-cover-mist\"></div> <div class=\"character-info\"><div class=\"character-info-prop\"><img src=\"https://fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/166076/b60b27574c9c70a791f7c46e7eda7c9c_7431480135044190857.png\" alt=\"\"> <img src=\"https://fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/166076/47fc72d0dae8e4f9d4889dfd5b11a4bc_281900660500507983.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <div class=\"character-info-name\"><!----> <span>赛维里安·洛威尔</span></div> <div class=\"character-voice-player\"><div class=\"character-voice-btn\"><div class=\"character-voice-btn-inner\"><div class=\"character-voice-btn-inner-highlight\"></div></div></div> <span class=\"character-voice-player-name\"><span>CV: </span> <span class=\"character-voice-player-name-text\">杨超然</span></span> <div class=\"character-voice-lang-switcher character-voice-lang-switcher__0\"><span>中</span></div></div> <div class=\"character-info-desc-container\"><div class=\"__vuescroll hasVBar vBarVisible\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%; padding: 0px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\"><div class=\"__panel __hidebar\" style=\"position: relative; box-sizing: border-box; height: 100%; overflow: hidden scroll;\"><div class=\"__view\" style=\"position: relative; box-sizing: border-box; min-width: 100%; min-height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><div class=\"character-info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">「你们说大魔…呃，洛威尔长官？等、等等…他不在附近吧？你们确定？…好，那我就直说了！我从没见过他笑！他是真正的、真正的、真正的恶魔！」</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">——谨慎观察周围后，说话声越来越小、又陡然大叫起来的希希芙</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">「大家都说，『赛维里安·洛威尔长官是所有治安官的榜样』。但我…好吧，虽然听起来有点可笑，但他不是我的榜样。如果『他能按照自己说好的时间回家』？那也不是！」</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">——赛斯</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">「黑枝的档案里有他的资料。呃，这会不会有点夸张…我知道要『避免与之发生冲突』，但也不用最大字号、红色字体，加粗标注三次吧？」</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">——菲欧妮</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">「长官他…好像会在大家出外勤的时候，给我的番茄和青衣前辈的绿植浇水？虽然我没有证据。我暂时还无法想象和他讨论任何工作以外的问题…」</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">——朱鸢</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p></div><div style=\"display: block; position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; opacity: 0; z-index: -1000; pointer-events: none;\"><object type=\"text/html\" tabindex=\"-1\" data=\"about:blank\" style=\"display: block; position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; opacity: 0; z-index: -1000; pointer-events: none;\"></object></div></div></div><div class=\"__rail-is-vertical\" style=\"position: absolute; z-index: 1; border-radius: 0.05rem; background: rgb(222, 222, 222); border: none; width: 0.05rem; top: 0px; bottom: 0px; right: 2px;\"><div class=\"__bar-wrap-is-vertical\" style=\"position: absolute; border-radius: 0.05rem; top: 0px; bottom: 0px; width: 100%;\"><div class=\"__bar-is-vertical\" style=\"cursor: pointer; position: absolute; margin: auto; transition: opacity 0.5s; user-select: none; border-radius: inherit; height: 18.7032%; background: rgb(192, 192, 192); width: 0.05rem; opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0%); left: 0px; right: 0px;\"></div></div></div></div> <div class=\"character-info-desc-cover\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"character-swiper-slide swiper-slide swiper-slide-next\" style=\"width: 390px; opacity: 0; transform: translate3d(-390px, 0px, 0px);\"><img src=\"https://fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/162680/f6486fc7e705e440614186a5aab4c42e_5196093619953562562.png\" class=\"character-cover\"> <div class=\"character-cover-mist\"></div> <div class=\"character-info\"><div class=\"character-info-prop\"><img src=\"https://fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/162680/9c940fbfbc5914ec6968b608b9bd7c22_5193981200505614243.png\" alt=\"\"> <img src=\"https://fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/162680/9c235bd990f3bce4af09d143c3f6d596_9039414943938262372.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <div class=\"character-info-name\"><i style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/162680/ef4310d8f18a62aa70f412fb534b1086_2189861633491864557.png&quot;);\"></i> <span>希希芙</span></div> <div class=\"character-voice-player\"><div class=\"character-voice-btn\"><div class=\"character-voice-btn-inner\"><div class=\"character-voice-btn-inner-highlight\"></div></div></div> <span class=\"character-voice-player-name\"><span>CV: </span> <span class=\"character-voice-player-name-text\">降温</span></span> <div class=\"character-voice-lang-switcher character-voice-lang-switcher__0\"><span>中</span></div></div> <div class=\"character-info-desc-container\"><div class=\"__vuescroll hasVBar vBarVisible\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%; padding: 0px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\"><div class=\"__panel __hidebar\" style=\"position: relative; box-sizing: border-box; height: 100%; overflow: hidden scroll;\"><div class=\"__view\" style=\"position: relative; box-sizing: border-box; min-width: 100%; min-height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><div class=\"character-info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">「谁是治安局的？你说的是我？求求你，别说这种鬼故事！」</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">——被问起她成为案件专员的经过时</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">「她这个月的报销款项是…3面橱窗玻璃、1辆旧能源轿车、还有…27碗蛋包饭？别多问，转至长官的个人账户即可，这些案件专员的花费从来不走公账，也不需要理由。」</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">——都市秩序部的财务核算专员正在告知新来的同事</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">「对她的合作评价吗？大概是绝对不会把饭分给别人吃的，自私又可爱的『同事』吧~」</p><p style=\"white-space: p\n<!-- … truncated, 7513 chars total -->",
